nav></header><main id=\"main\" style=\"min-height:60vh\"><section style=\"position:relative;min-height:60vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;color:#F5F1E8;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top, rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.18) 0%, #0A0A0A 70%);background-size:cover;background-position:center;padding:120px 24px 60px;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"max-width:980px;width:100%\"><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(40px, 8vw, 80px);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:0.92;margin:0;color:#F5F1E8\"><span>Book<!-- --> </span><span>a<!-- --> </span><span>Session</span></h1><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-marker);font-size:20px;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:28px;opacity:0.9;letter-spacing:0.01em;max-width:640px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">Free consultation first. Deposit to lock in your slot. Walk-ins welcome too.</p></div></section><section style=\"padding:60px 24px 80px\"><div style=\"max-width:960px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"text-align:left;margin-bottom:48px;max-width:960px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:#8B0000;margin-bottom:12px\">Booking</div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);line-height:0.95;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0\">Online booking coming soon</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:20px;opacity:0.85\">We&#x27;re setting up the booking system. In the meantime, you&#x27;ve got three easy ways to get on the schedule.</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));gap:24px;margin-bottom:48px\"><div style=\"background:var(--color-bone-white);color:var(--color-ink-black);padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:2px solid var(--color-bleed-red)\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-marker);color:#8B0000;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px\">Fastest</div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px\">Call us</h3><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;opacity:0.85\">Speak to Isiah or Courtney directly during shop hours. We can often fit walk-ins in the same day.</p><a href=\"tel:+12159801386\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;color:#8B0000;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin-top:auto\">(215) 980-1386</a><div style=\"font-size:12px;opacity:0.6;margin-top:8px\">Tue–Sat, 11 AM – 7 PM</div></div><div style=\"background:var(--color-bone-white);color:var(--color-ink-black);padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.1)\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-marker);color:#8B0000;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px\">No appointment</div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px\">Walk in</h3><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;opacity:0.85\">Pop into the shop any time we&#x27;re open for a free consultation. No appointment needed.</p><div style=\"margin-top:auto;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5\"><strong>Johnstown Galleria</strong><br/>500 Galleria Dr<br/>Johnstown, PA 15904</div></div><div style=\"background:var(--color-bone-white);color:var(--color-ink-black);padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.1)\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-marker);color:#8B0000;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px\">Async</div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px\">Send a message</h3><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;opacity:0.85\">Drop us a description of your idea and we&#x27;ll get back within 2 business days.</p><a style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:auto;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:#8B0000;text-decoration:none\" href=\"/contact\">Open contact form →</a></div></div><div style=\"padding:32px;background:#8B0000;color:#F5F1E8;text-align:center\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;margin-bottom:12px\">$65<!-- --> deposit to lock in your slot</h3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;opacity:0.95\">Non-refundable. Comes off the price of your final tattoo.</p></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer style=\"background:#0A0A0A;color:#F5F1E8;margin-top:80px\"><div style=\"max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 24px 24px\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));gap:48px;padding-bottom:48px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.15)\"><div><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:-0.02em\">Bleeding <span style=\"color:#8B0000\">Ink</span></h3><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:14px;opacity:0.85;line-height:1.6\"><div>Johnstown Galleria</div><div>500 Galleria Dr</div><div>Johnstown<!-- -->, <!-- -->PA<!-- --> <!-- -->15904</div><a href=\"tel:+12159801386\" style=\"color:#F5F1E8;text-decoration:none;margin-top:8px;font-weight:600\">(215) 980-1386</a></div></div><div><h4 style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;margin-bottom:16px;color:#8B0000\">Hours</h4><ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8\"><li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;opacity:0.5\"><span>Sunday</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Closed</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;opacity:0.5\"><span>Monday</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Closed</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;opacity:1\"><span>Tuesday</span><span style=\"font-weight:600\">11:00 AM – 7:00 PM</span